(PA*BY)*" instead? As far, as i (don't really) know that would harm no
grammar, and, probably, would be the shortest alternative possible due to
frequently skipped 'y's (ignore the wrong, capitalized tags): de'i la
renopamuN feiL cipaD, or la reDYpaL, etc.

